        },
        {
          "text": "Worri kunini ch'ufti waan takaa baase: d'ameela qarsi toko ka ulfinni isaa kilo tokofi nusa, ammalle qori qarsi toko ta ulfinni isii diquma kilo hanqatu, aka biima gaafasi gula, ta lachu dargayeeni d'ad'a wolti makhani miju, ta sorio mid'aani baasani; idina worqi ka hit'aani miju, ka ulfinni isaa kiloleti ind'iaanne: Jibicha korma toko, elemo toko, elemo toko ka ganna toko, wonti kunini ch'ufti waan gubani sorio baasani; korbeesa toko ka sorio dabaani ufi iraa baasani baasani; koromi lamafi elemiye shani, korbeeyyi shani, elemiye shani ta ganna toko, wonti kunini ch'ufti waan sorio wold'ageeti baasani.",
          "type": "text",
