          "items": [
            {
              "text": "84",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henni waan worri gugurdaani kud'ani lamaani kaani baase, gaafa fulla sorio iti qalani suni muudani eebisani kana: d'ameela qarsi kud'ani lamafi qori qarsi kud'ani lama, ta ulfinni isii diquma kilo 28 hanqattu; idina worqi kud'ani lama, ka hit'aani miju, ka ulfinni isaa diquma kilo toko ira jiru; koromi kud'ani lama, elemiye kud'ani lama, elemiye kud'ani lama ta ganna tokotifi mid'aani gubani hori kanani woliini sorio baasani; korbeeyyi kud'ani lama ta sorio dabaani ufi iraa baasani baasani: Koromi diddami afuri, elemiye jaatama, korbeeyyi jaatama, elemiye jaatama ta ganna toko, wonti kunini ch'ufti waan sorio wold'ageeti baasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.84+NUM.7.85+NUM.7.86+NUM.7.87+NUM.7.88",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.84",
              "NUM.7.85",
              "NUM.7.86",
              "NUM.7.87",
              "NUM.7.88"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "89",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:89"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "89",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musani Waaro Woyyuma olesene, aka AABBO Waaqaani dubbatu, jennaani inni AABBO Waaqa, ka qadaada Sanduqa Wold'aqisa gubba jiddu waan koola kaani lamaaniti isaani dubbatu d'agaye.",
